  Slug: hooded-nagaji
  DisplayName: Hooded Nagaji
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: You bear the hooded head of a spitting cobra, and like such cobras,
    you can shoot streams of venom from your mouth. You gain a venomous spit ranged
    unarmed attack with a range increment of 10 feet that deals 1d4 poison damage.
    On a critical hit, the target takes persistent poison damage equal to the number
    of weapon damage dice. Your spit doesn't have a weapon group or a critical specialization
    effect.
